Subject: [PATCH 37/60] Sync the liveness engine: F17 ModelUpdater.installZip

Engine jars from Mosip26 b3586d5 (f17-offline-model-install: "F17:
ModelUpdater.installZip, a signed bundle zip from removable media").
The analyzer can now install a signed model bundle zip from a local
file, with the online update's unpack rules and verification
(installZip), and report the version new sessions use (activeVersion).
The models and CameraXFrameSource.java are unchanged (same SHA-256).

Tested together with the next commit (the F17 install page), which
uses it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
